  | ![](https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif) |  | [throwaway744678](https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=throwaway744678) [on April 1, 2021](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=26660631) \| [parent](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=26659740#26660605) \| [next](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=26659740#26659792)\[–\]<br>For the cursor part, most keyboard allow precise cursor movements by swiping the space bar. | |
