  | ![](https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif) |  | [tubularhells](https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=tubularhells) [on April 1, 2021](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=26660424) \| [prev](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=26659740#26660019)\[–\]<br>Imagine a world where some people speak more than one language on a daily basis.<br>Wild, I know. | | |
